exports[`templates > access renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1270" height="903" viewBox="0 0 1270 903" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1yppqvy1539-title" aria-describedby="carto-1yppqvy1539-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1yppqvy1539-title">Engineering access</title><desc id="carto-1yppqvy1539-desc">Roles, groups and access packages diagram: Entra ID access packages and Azure roles. 14 elements in 2 groups, with 14 connections.

Groups and elements
- Engineering (department = Engineering)
- Engineering (Catalog)
  - Approval: manager (180 days · review quarterly)
  - Approval: manager → sg-platform-admins (30 days)
  - Developer access (Access package)
  - Platform admin (Access package)
- sg-developers (Security group)
- GitHub Enterprise (Application)
- sg-platform-admins (Role-assignable group)
- Test (Subscription)
- Production (Subscription)
  - rg-shop (Resource group)
- Contoso partners (Connected organisation)
- Alice (User)
- Bob (Contoso) (Guest)
- GitHub deploy (Service principal)

Connections
- Engineering (department = Engineering) connects to Approval: manager and connects to Approval: manager → sg-platform-admins.
- Approval: manager connects to Developer access.
- Approval: manager → sg-platform-admins connects to Platform admin.
- Developer access grants sg-developers and grants GitHub Enterprise (User).
- Platform admin grants sg-platform-admins.
- sg-developers is Contributor on Test and is Reader on Production.
- sg-platform-admins is Owner on Production.
- Contoso partners connects to Approval: manager.
- Alice holds Developer access.
- Bob (Contoso) holds Developer access.
- GitHub deploy is Contributor on rg-shop.

Key
- Solid green line with beads: Holds package
- Dashed line: Can request
- Solid violet line with ticks: Package grants
- Solid sky line: Role assignment</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1270" height="903" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1249 12H1258V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 891H12V882" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1249 891H1258V882" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Engineering access</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Entra ID access packages and Azure roles</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="121.5" y="99" width="667.5" height="294" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(137.5 114) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#7655C1" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="14" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"/></g><text x="159.5" y="124.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">ENGINEERING</text><text x="249.4" y="125.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Catalog</text></g><g><rect x="196.4" y="571" width="283.6" height="134" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(212.4 586) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#806514" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.36"/><path d="M19 12v6"/><path d="M19 14h2"/><circle cx="19" cy="20" r="2"/></g><text x="234.4" y="596.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">PRODUCTION</text><text x="322.9" y="597.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Subscri