exports[`templates > c4 renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="612" height="627" viewBox="0 0 612 627" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1osh1sf755-title" aria-describedby="carto-1osh1sf755-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1osh1sf755-title">Web shop — system context</title><desc id="carto-1osh1sf755-desc">C4 model. 5 elements, with 4 connections.

Elements
- Customer (Person): Buys products online
- Web shop (Software System): Sells products and takes orders
- Payment provider (Software System, external): Charges cards
- E-mail service (Software System, external): Sends order confirmations
- Shop staff (Person): Keeps products and prices up to date

Connections
- Customer connects to Web shop (Browses and orders [HTTPS]).
- Web shop connects to Payment provider (Charges cards [REST]) and connects to E-mail service (Sends confirmations [SMTP]).
- Shop staff connects to Web shop (Manages the catalogue [HTTPS]).

Key
- Indigo icon: Person
- Blue icon: Software system
- Icon, greyed: External system
