exports[`templates > cloud renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1158" height="843" viewBox="0 0 1158 843" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-jtfs801265-title" aria-describedby="carto-jtfs801265-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-jtfs801265-title">Web shop on AWS</title><desc id="carto-jtfs801265-desc">AWS and Google Cloud diagram: Production, two availability zones. 8 elements in 8 groups, with 7 connections.

Groups and elements
- Users
- CDN and WAF (CloudFront)
- shop-prod (123456789012 · eu-west-1)
  - vpc-shop (VPC · 10.0.0.0/16)
    - Internet gateway
    - Load balancer (ALB · a public subnet per zone)
    - eu-west-1a (Availability zone)
      - Private subnet (10.0.10.0/24)
        - Web shop (ECS service · 2 tasks)
      - Isolated subnet (10.0.20.0/24)
        - Orders reader (Aurora instance · same cluster)
    - eu-west-1b (Availability zone)
      - Private subnet (10.0.11.0/24)
        - Web shop (ECS service · 2 tasks)
      - Isolated subnet (10.0.21.0/24)
        - Orders writer (Aurora instance · cluster orders)

Connections
- Users send traffic to CDN and WAF over HTTPS.
- CDN and WAF sends traffic to Internet gateway.
- Internet gateway sends traffic to Load balancer.
- Load balancer connects to Web shop (ECS service) (Private network) and connects to Web shop (ECS service) (Private network).
- Web shop (ECS service) connects to Orders writer (Private network).
- Web shop (ECS service) connects to Orders writer (Private network: SQL).

Key
- Solid sky line: Public traffic
- Dashed teal line: Private network</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1158" height="843" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1137 12H1146V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 831H12V822" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1137 831H1146V822" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Web shop on AWS</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Production, two availability zones</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="248" y="6" width="829.5" height="639" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(264 21) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#806514" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.36"/><path d="M19 12v6"/><path d="M19 14h2"/><circle cx="19" cy="20" r="2"/></g><text x="286" y="31.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">SHOP-PROD</text><text x="367.2" y="32.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">123456789012 · eu-west-1</text></g><g><rect x="268" y="62" width="789.5" height="563" rx="8" fill="#F0EDE4" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(284 77) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#1E7495" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m10.586 5.414-5.172 5.172"/><path d="m18.586 13.414-5.172 5.172"/><path d="M6 12h12"/><circle cx="12" cy="20" r="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="4" r="2"/><circle cx="20" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="4" cy="12" r="2"/></g><text x="306" y="87.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">VPC-SHOP</text><text x="378.4" y="88.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">VPC · 10.0.0.0/16</