exports[`templates > context-map renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1110" height="665" viewBox="0 0 1110 665" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1ieyvj21110-title" aria-describedby="carto-1ieyvj21110-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1ieyvj21110-title">E-commerce context map</title><desc id="carto-1ieyvj21110-desc">Context map: Bounded contexts and how they integrate. 7 elements in 2 groups, with 6 connections.

Groups and elements
- Sales (Domain)
  - Catalogue (Supporting subdomain)
  - Ordering (Core domain)
  - Pricing (Core domain)
- Fulfilment (Domain)
  - Shipping (Supporting subdomain)
  - Warehouse ERP (Legacy system)
- Billing (Generic subdomain)
- Payment provider (External system)

Connections
- Catalogue (upstream, open host service, published language) and Ordering (downstream): Customer/Supplier.
- Ordering (upstream) and Shipping (downstream): Customer/Supplier.
- Ordering (upstream) and Billing (downstream): Customer/Supplier.
- Pricing is linked with Ordering (Partnership).
- Warehouse ERP (upstream) and Shipping (downstream, anticorruption layer): stock levels.
- Payment provider (upstream) and Billing (downstream, conformist).

Key
- Tag U: Upstream
- Tag D: Downstream
- Tag OHS: Open host service
- Tag PL: Published language
- Tag ACL: Anticorruption layer
- Tag CF: Conformist
- Violet icon: Core domain
- Blue icon: Supporting subdomain
- Icon: Generic subdomain</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1110" height="665" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1089 12H1098V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 653H12V644" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1089 653H1098V644" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">E-commerce context map</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Bounded contexts and how they integrate</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="2.5" y="146" width="504" height="215" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(18.5 161) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#40429B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"/><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"/><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"/></g><text x="40.5" y="171.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">SALES</text><text x="86.8" y="172.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Domain</text></g><g><rect x="300" y="7" width="729.5" height="122" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(316 22) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#40429B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"/><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"/><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"/></