exports[`templates > journey renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1382" height="803" viewBox="0 0 1382 803" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-wxldp61111-title" aria-describedby="carto-wxldp61111-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-wxldp61111-title">A developer's first week</title><desc id="carto-wxldp61111-desc">Journey map. Dana's journey through 3 phases and 5 steps.

Persona: Dana
- Role: New backend developer
- Goal: Ship a first change to production
- Says: “I want to feel useful this week.”

By phase
- First day
  - Collect laptop and accounts (feels 4 of 5)
    - Through IT desk
    - With: Buddy
  - Find the right repository (feels lost, 2 of 5)
    - Thinks: “Which of these 40 repositories is ours?”
    - Through GitHub and Wiki
    - Pain: No map of the landscape
    - Idea: One page with the team's systems
- First commit
  - Run the service locally (feels 3 of 5)
    - Through Terminal
  - Open a pull request (feels welcome, 4 of 5)
    - Says: “That was a quick review!”
    - Through GitHub
    - With: Reviewer
    - Works well: Review within the hour
- First deploy
  - Deploy to production (feels proud, 5 of 5)
    - Through Pipeline and Portal
    - Works well: One button, no ticket
    - Measured: Time to first deploy: 4 days

Feeling
Lowest at “Find the right repository” (2 of 5); highest at “Deploy to production” (5 of 5).

Metrics
- Time to first deploy: 4 days</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1382" height="803" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1361 12H1370V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 791H12V782" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1361 791H1370V782" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">A developer's first week</text><g transform="translate(40 84)"><g><g transform="translate(0 0)"><circle cx="28" cy="28" r="28" fill="#EAEAF6" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M11.1 49.6C11.7 41.4 18.1 36.8 28 36.8C37.9 36.8 44.3 41.4 44.9 49.6" fill="none" stroke="#40429B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="28" cy="21.6" r="9.3" fill="#EAEAF6" stroke="#40429B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M17.5 29.2C16.3 26.3 16.3 23.9 16.3 21C16.3 13.4 21.6 8.8 28 8.8C34.4 8.8 39.7 13.4 39.7 21C39.7 23.9 39.7 26.3 38.5 29.2" fill="none" stroke="#40429B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M20.1 18.2L35.9 18.2" fill="none" stroke="#40429B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="70" y="15.4" font-size="15" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Dana</text><text x="70" y="32.8" font-size="12" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">New backend developer</text><text x="70" y="54" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#5D6670">Goal</text><text x="104" y="54.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Ship a first change to production</text><rect x="307.6" y="11" width="207" height="36" rx="5" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#99948A" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M308.6 23L300.6 29L308.6 35Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/><path d="M307.6 23L300.6 29L307.6 35" fill="none" stroke="#99948A" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="321.6" y="33.5" font-size="12.5" font-weight="400" fill="#16212C">“I want to feel useful this week.”</text><text x="1200.8" y="27.1" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">4 days</text><text x="1200.8" y="45.5" font-size="11" font-weight="500" fill="#4F5B66">Time to first deploy</text><path d="M114 80L569 80L578 95L569 110L114 110Z" fill="#E6EDF6" stroke="#E6EDF6" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="316.5" y="99.5" font-size="12.5" font-weight="600" fill="#2B62A3">First day</text><path d="M592 80L1047 80L1056 95L1047 110L592 110L601 95Z" fill="#EAEAF6" stroke="#EAEAF6" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="786.5" y="99.5" font-size="12.5" font-weight="600" fill="#40429B">First commit</text><path d="M1070 80L1293 80L1302 95L1293 110L1070 110L1079 95Z" fill="#F0E9F5" stroke="#F0E9F5" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="1151.6" y="99.5" font-size="12.5" font-weight="600" fill="#7655C1">First deploy</text><g transform="translate(0 135) scale(0.5417000000000001)" fill="none" stroke="#4E5A65" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="3"/><path d="M9 19h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-11a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H15"/><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/></g><text x="19" y="145.6" font-size="11.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66">Doing</text><rect x="118" y="122" width="224" height="58" rx="5" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#99948A" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="137" cy="141" r="9" fill="#E6EDF6"/><text x="137" y="145" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#2B62A3" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="153" y="145.5" font-size="12.5" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Collect laptop and accounts</text><g transform="translate(130 157.5) scale(0.4583)" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="3.8" stroke-linecap="rou