exports[`templates > kubernetes renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1399" height="668" viewBox="0 0 1399 668" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-114k3er930-title" aria-describedby="carto-114k3er930-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-114k3er930-title">Web shop</title><desc id="carto-114k3er930-desc">Kubernetes diagram: Production cluster. 7 elements in 2 groups, with 11 connections.

Groups and elements
- Users
- prod-eu (Cluster)
  - shop (Namespace)
    - shop (Ingress · shop.example.com)
    - web (Service · :80)
    - api (Service · :80→8080)
    - web (Deployment · ×2 · web:2.3)
    - api (Deployment · ×3 · api:1.4)
    - postgres (StatefulSet · postgres:16)

Connections
- Users send traffic to shop (Ingress) over HTTPS.
- shop (Ingress) sends traffic to web (Service) (/) and sends traffic to api (Service) (/api).
- web (Service) sends traffic to web (Deployment).
- api (Service) sends traffic to api (Deployment).
- api (Deployment) sends traffic to postgres (SQL), mounts api-config, mounts db-credentials and is scaled by HPA ×3–10.
- postgres mounts db-credentials and mounts data · 20Gi.

Key
- Solid blue line: Traffic
- Badge: Mounted config, secret or volume
- Green badge: Scaled by an autoscaler</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1399" height="668" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1378 12H1387V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 656H12V647" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1378 656H1387V647" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Web shop</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Production cluster</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="6" y="139" width="1313" height="331" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(22 154) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#2B62A3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><path d="M12 2v7.5"/><path d="m19 5-5.23 5.23"/><path d="M22 12h-7.5"/><path d="m19 19-5.23-5.23"/><path d="M12 14.5V22"/><path d="M10.23 13.77 5 19"/><path d="M9.5 12H2"/><path d="M10.23 10.23 5 5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"/></g><text x="44" y="164.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">PROD-EU</text><text x="107.8" y="165.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Cluster</text></g><g><rect x="26" y="183" width="1273" height="267" rx="8" fill="#F0EDE4" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(42 198) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#4E5A65" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 20a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.69-.9L9.6 3.9A2 2 0 0 0 7.93 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2Z"/></g><text x="64" y="208.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">SHOP</text><text x="105.6" y="209.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Namespace</text></g><g><path d="M88 61L88 117Q88 12