exports[`templates > process renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1111" height="506" viewBox="0 0 1111 506" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-p6mspt904-title" aria-describedby="carto-p6mspt904-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-p6mspt904-title">Access request</title><desc id="carto-p6mspt904-desc">Process diagram: From request to access, approved by the line manager. 9 elements in 3 lanes, with 8 connections.

Lanes and steps
- Employee (lane)
  - Start event
  - Request access
  - Confirm access
  - End event
- Line manager (lane)
  - Check request
  - Approved? (decision)
  - Explain why
  - Request rejected (end event)
- IT service desk (lane)
  - Grant access

Main path
1. Start event
2. Request access
3. Check request
4. Approved?
5. Grant access (Approved?: yes)
6. Confirm access
7. End event

Connections
- Start event leads to Request access.
- Request access leads to Check request.
- Check request leads to Approved?
- Approved? leads to Grant access (yes) and leads to Explain why (no).
- Grant access leads to Confirm access.
- Explain why leads to Request rejected.
- Confirm access leads to End event.

Key
- Solid line, thick: Happy path
