exports[`templates > states renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="715" height="662" viewBox="0 0 715 662" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1viwlwy965-title" aria-describedby="carto-1viwlwy965-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1viwlwy965-title">Order lifecycle</title><desc id="carto-1viwlwy965-desc">States diagram: The states an order can be in, and what moves it on. 9 states in 1 group, with 10 transitions.

Groups and elements
- Start
- Awaiting payment: entry / reserve stock
- Fulfilment
  - Start of Fulfilment
  - Picking: do / collect the items
  - Packed: entry / print the label
- Cancelled: entry / release stock
- Shipped
- End
- Delivered

Main path
1. Start
2. Awaiting payment: order placed
3. Picking: payment received
4. Shipped: handed to carrier
5. Delivered: signed for
6. End

Transitions
- Start moves to Awaiting payment on order placed.
- Awaiting payment moves to Fulfilment on payment received and moves to Cancelled on 30 min without payment.
- Fulfilment moves to Cancelled on customer cancels and moves to Shipped on handed to carrier.
- Cancelled moves to End.
- Shipped moves to Delivered on signed for.
- Delivered moves to End.
- Start of Fulfilment moves to Picking.
- Picking moves to Packed on all items scanned.</desc><defs></defs><rect width="715" height="662" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M694 12H703V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 650H12V641" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M694 650H703V641" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Order lifecycle</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">The states an order can be in, and what moves it on</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="19" y="153" width="616" height="134" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><text x="57" y="178.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">FULFILMENT</text></g><g><path d="M24 25L24 33Q24 41 32 41L169 41" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M165 36.5L174 41L165 45.5Q167 41 165 36.5Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><path d="M260 75L260 148" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M264.5 144L260 153L255.5 144Q260 146 264.5 144Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><path d="M57 232L155 232" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M151 227.5L160 232L151 236.5Q153 232 151 227.5Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><path d="M304 232L468 232" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M464 227.5L473 232L464 236.5Q466 232 464 227.5Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><path d="M339 287L339 441Q339 449 331 449L74 449Q6