exports[`templates > teams renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="541" height="535" viewBox="0 0 541 535" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1qxyqrv646-title" aria-describedby="carto-1qxyqrv646-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1qxyqrv646-title">Product and technology</title><desc id="carto-1qxyqrv646-desc">Org chart: Org chart and team topology, Q3. 6 people and 1 open role, led by Anna de Vries.

Who reports to whom
Each person, with the people who report to them under them.
- Anna de Vries, Chief product and technology officer
  - Bo Jansen, Head of product
    - Dana Smit, Product lead Checkout (Checkout)
    - Eli Bakker, Product lead Search (Search)
  - Cem Yilmaz, Head of engineering
    - Fay Visser, Platform lead (Platform)
    - Vacancy: SRE coach (Enablement, open role)

Dotted lines
- Fay Visser also reports to Bo Jansen.

Key
